{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BgBeV9QTv91ydy49eHUP6z","type":"tool_result","content":"1:# Ice Hoc-Kaboom\n9:## 0. The game at a glance\n46:### Title pick (as TASK.md says)\n54:## 1. Deliverables, folders and working rules\n98:## 2. Engine and hub facts the build relies on (verified while planning)\n164:## 3. Design decisions in brief (why this shape)\n177:## 4. Engine changes (make them in `engine/my-3d2dge.js`, log each in ENGINE-CHANGES.md)\n209:## 5. Architecture\n211:### 5.1 Runtime shape\n229:### 5.2 Source modules (`src/`, concatenated in this order into one IIFE)\n269:### 5.3 Entities (plain objects, owned by `Match`)\n282:### 5.4 The match step (fixed order; deterministic; `Match.step(dt)`)\n304:### 5.5 Debug handle (tests and tools read it)\n313:## 6. Controls (one game on every device)\n315:### 6.1 Actions and default bindings (`HOCKEY_KEYS`, built from `E.Input.DEFAULT`'s menu keys)\n346:### 6.2 Prompts and glyphs\n359:## 7. Systems (rules, numbers, behavior)\n363:### 7.1 The rink (`Rink`)\n397:### 7.2 Skating (`Skater.skateStep`, pure: the network prediction runs it too)\n417:### 7.3 The puck (`Puck`)\n438:### 7.4 Passing\n455:### 7.5 Shooting\n470:### 7.6 Goalies (`Goalie`)\n494:### 7.7 Checking, the glass, grudges (`Hits`)\n512:### 7.8 Deke and poke\n520:### 7.9 Chirping (`chirp`)\n526:### 7.10 The BOOM meter and KABOOM mode (`Boom`)\n542:### 7.11 Fights and the sin bin (`Fight`)\n569:### 7.12 Fan throws, power-ups and hazards (`Items`)\n605:### 7.13 Team AI (`AI`)\n631:### 7.14 Match flow (`Match`)\n667:### 7.15 Camera director (`Cam`)\n677:### 7.16 Instant replay (`Replay`)\n688:### 7.17 Commentary (`Talk`)\n700:### 7.18 HUD (`Hud`; it keeps clear of `game.cornerArea()` and inside a 92% title-safe area)\n719:## 8. Art direction\n754:## 9. Animation (the engine's procedural rigs plus new hockey motion)\n792:## 10. Audio (all synthesized in code; no audio files)\n794:### 10.1 Voices: babble (Animalese/Simlish style)\n809:### 10.2 Sound effects (`audio.define` voices; custom graphs where noted)\n822:### 10.3 Crowd and organ\n833:### 10.4 Music (engine song format; the new `organ` and `brass` waves; named layers)\n854:## 11. Content\n856:### 11.1 Teams (3 skaters + 1 goalie each; ratings 1–5: Spd / Sht / Pas / Hit / Fgt / Hnd; goalies Rfx / Size / Reb)\n879:### 11.2 Arenas\n893:### 11.3 Story: THE CUP RUN\n980:### 11.4 Practice: Coach Marge's Drills (at the Ol' Icebox, house lights half on)\n995:### 11.5 Text pools (in `07-data-text.js`; sizes are the minimums)\n1001:## 12. Screens and flows (10-foot UI)\n1037:### 12.1 About / Credits screen\n1047:## 13. Settings (via `menu.settings`; the engine's Display, Sound, Comfort and Controls stay)\n1055:## 14. Online: AI Hub sessions (`Net`, shared-world)\n1057:### 14.1 Page tags (in `<head>`, after the session client)\n1069:### 14.2 Flow (when `AIHub.active`)\n1104:### 14.3 Netcode (it stays within 20 messages a second per copy and 16 KB per message)\n1127:## 15. Attract mode, touch-only devices and dev mode\n1129:### 15.1 Attract mode (scene `attract`)\n1150:### 15.2 Touch-only devices\n1159:### 15.3 Dev mode (scene overlay `Dev`, from the pause menu's **Dev Mode** item; also `#dev`)\n1182:## 16. Build order and milestones\n1201:## 17. Risks and how to de-risk them\n1217:## 18. Testing\n1226:### 18.1 Unit (pure functions)\n1234:### 18.2 Systems (headless game)\n1251:### 18.3 Scripted playthrough of the whole game (`tests/play-story.mjs`)\n1266:### 18.4 Other headless suites\n1276:### 18.5 Fake-hub network test (headless, Node)\n1283:### 18.6 Browser suites (Playwright 1.63, Chromium; `TMPDIR` set)\n1297:### 18.7 Screenshots (only for what scripts can't judge; `tests/shots.mjs`)\n1306:## 19. Definition of done (TASK.md → where it is met)\n1333:## Appendix A: Tuning defaults (`T`; every row is a Dev slider)\n1379:## Appendix B: Event catalogue (`Bus`; consumers: stats, objectives, Talk, Fx, Crowd, Net, Replay)\n1391:## Appendix 