ion-mode\" content=\"shared-world\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-goal\" content=\"Score more goals than the other side before the final horn. Overtime is sudden death, then a shootout.\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-howto\" content=\"Move: left stick or WASD. Pass: X or J. Shoot: Square or K (hold for a slapshot). Deke: O or L. Lob or gloves: triangle or I. Turbo: R2 or Shift. KABOOM: B.\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-minutes\" content=\"6\">\"\"\"\ns=s.replace(old,new)\nopen(p,'w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs >/dev/null && head -c 400 ../IceHoc-Kaboom-IceHockey-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-055947.html; echo; grep -c \"hub:session\" ../IceHoc-Kaboom-IceHockey-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-055947.html","description":"Vendor hub files and add hub tags and client to build"}}}
