{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013c7MHeBxQDs88QytEttijS","type":"tool_result","content":"### 7.12 Fan throws, power-ups and hazards (`Items`)\n- **Throws**: every `T.itemEvery` 25–45 s of play, and 25% of the time right after a big hit or goal, a fan in the\n  stands throws (a lob arc from the crowd over the glass) onto the neutral or attacking zone. The item slides to a stop\n  and lasts 12 s (blinking for its last 3). Arena pools are in 11.2.\n- **Pickup**: a skater body within 12. Icons and timers show over the holder's head.\n\n| Item | Look | Effect |\n|---|---|---|\n| HOT SAUCE | red bottle (store `bottle`) | infinite turbo 8 s, fire trail |\n| GRANDMA'S TAPE | white tape roll | 10 s: can't lose the puck to pokes or checks below a big hit; passes can't be intercepted |\n| POUTINE | bowl of fries (store `bowl`) | 10 s: can't be knocked down; every check is a big hit (×1.6) |\n| LUMBER | a stick with a lightning bolt | the next 3 shots: +30% speed, zero error |\n| BRICK PADS | a brick | the holder's goalie grows ×1.35 for 12 s |\n| BOOM BOX | a boombox | +40 team BOOM |\n| HOT COCOA (pond only) | a steaming thermos | turbo refilled + 20% speed 8 s |\n\n| Hazard | Where | Effect |\n|---|---|---|\n| OCTOPUS | Grindhouse, Dome, cheat | a slip patch r 10: skaters crossing it `slip` (1.2 s, legs up, a slide); at the next stoppage the referee picks it up and twirls it overhead |\n| RUBBER RAT | Grindhouse | scurries randomly for 10 s; trips skaters (as slip) |\n| HATS | after any hat trick | 20–40 hats rain from the stands (cosmetic, swept up at the stoppage) |\n\n- **AI item greed**: a CPU skater not involved in the play (not the carrier, its marker or the pressure player)\n  detours to an item within 120 (`T.aiItemGreed`).\n- **Arena hazards**:\n  - **Thin ice** (pond): 3 elliptical patches (40 × 24) at fixed spots outside the creases, each with integrity 100.\n    A knockdown on a patch costs 50 and a big hit there 100. At 0 the patch breaks into a hole: black water, ripples\n    and a splash. A skater who enters a hole is `frozen` for 3 s (rig tinted icy blue inside a translucent block),\n    then pops out at the edge. A puck that falls in is lost, then a faceoff. Holes refreeze (as a darker patch) after\n    30 s or at intermission.\n  - **Snowbanks** (pond): the boards are snowbanks with no glass. Restitution .3 and a snow puff. A big hit into one\n    leaves the target `buried` for 1.5 s with only the head and skates showing.\n  - **Polar Pete** (mall): the mascot skates figure eights in the neutral zone during play. A moving obstacle (mass\n    1.5) that can be checked (\"MASCOT DOWN!\", BOOM +10); it gets up after 3 s and waves.\n  - **Discount Drop** (mall): every 40 s a ceiling claw lowers a crate to center ice; it breaks into a power-up.\n\n### 7.13 Team AI (`AI`)\n- **Cadence**: each CPU skater re-thinks every `lerp(0.3, 0.12, skill)` s and reacts after `lerp(0.35, 0.1, skill)`\n======\n32:3. **Hockey culture and its voice.** The old barn, the arena organ, the ice resurfacer (our \"Flood Wagon\"), chirping,\n152:  `car.update(dt, map, { steer, gas, brake })`. It drives the Flood Wagon.\n219:  `cutscene`, `match` (pausable: all hockey play, including the shootout and the story games), `flood` (pausable: the\n226:  `#match/<home>/<away>/<arena>`, `#fight`, `#kaboom`, `#shootout`, `#flood`, `#practice/<1-7>`, `#results`,\n337:  the goalie, ✕ butterfly, □ poke, ○ dive. Flood Wagon: the stick steers toward that screen direction, R2/Shift is gas,\n395:  alpha by scuff), and melt draws blue-grey puddles with a shine. The Flood Wagon clears both.\n529:  one-timer +6, deke beat +6, chirp +3, BOOM Box item +40, mascot down +10, perfect Flood Wagon +30, Doris's organ\n633:  shootout: true, intros: true, replays: 'auto', flood: 'ask' | 'always' | 'never', difficulty, cheats, objectives,\n636:  `intermission` (Flood Wagon) → `faceoff` … `final` → `results`. Also `fight`, `ot`, `shootout` and `celebration`.\n650:- **Periods**: the buzzer at 0:00, then the period summary card. **Intermission**: the Flood Wagon minigame (offered\n651:  per the `flood` option; skipping runs a 6 s AI resurfacing fast-forward), then the next period. Teams switch ends\n783:| Story set pieces | The handshake line (two lines sliding past, hands out), the Cup lift (`cheer` with the Cup sprite held at the hands), the Flood Wagon driver seated and steering, Polar Pete's \n819:octopus \"splort\"; KABOOM explosion (engine `explode` + a sub-bass drop); the Flood Wagon engine (a looped low saw\n844:| `flood` | the Flood Wagon minigame | an original skaters' waltz (3/4, organ) |\n875:- **Coach and staff portraits**: Coach Marge Pelletier (grey bun, cardigan, whistle), Old Gus (90, cap, the Flood\n890:`flood-wagon`, `flame-cannon`, `cabin`, `fountain`, `escalator`, `storefront`, `scoreboard`, `kaboom-cup`) and\n905:objectives listed on the pause screen and a pre-game card) → intermission Flood Wagon (offered) → post-game cutscene →\n916:| 1 | **Home Opener** | Ol' Icebox vs Dryfork Drillers, 3 × 1:30; the rivals play one difficulty step below the setting (never below Rookie) | skating, passing, shooting, one-timers, checking, BOO\n972:Look it up.\" → GUS: \"Yep.\" → the Flood Wagon drives a lap with the team on top → **credits** over the run's highlight\n1050:Voices volume · Crowd volume · Player intros (On / Off) · Replays (Auto / Off) · Flood Wagon (Ask / Always / Never) ·\n1085:   3:00, then sudden-death OT capped at 1:00, then a tie. Replays are 3 s, there are no intros and no Flood Wagon;\n1142:  8. *Flood Wagon* (6 s): the AI driver resurfacing scuffed ice.\n1173:  break the thin ice; shatter a panel; trigger the Flood Wagon; go to results, attract, about or the lab.\n1194:| **M6 Story and content** | all 5 arenas dressed (lights, props, crowds, hazards), all 6 teams, the story map, the cutscene runner and every script, choices, objectives, stars and unlocks, the F\n1257:intermission Flood Wagon once with the bot steering, the chapter 4 Shootout Showcase, and the chapter 5 boss phases\n1300:cutscene with a portrait, the story map, a drill, the Flood Wagon, the Dev panel, Settings with Xbox glyphs, the\n1471:**Three stars (CHUCK)**: \"The third star: {name}, who hit everything but the Flood Wagon.\" · \"Second star: {name},","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e95508dc-65c4-494d-9367-fd17dc92e8aa","uuid":"5357c4a0-64b5-42e4-bd2c-aa4608d68ec7","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:04:58.536Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"### 7.12 Fan throws, power-ups and hazards (`Items`)\n- **Throws**: every `T.itemEvery` 25–45 s of play, and 25% of the time right after a big hit or goal, a fan in the\n  stands throws (a lob arc from the crowd over the glass) onto the neutral or attacking zone. The item slides to a stop\n  and lasts 12 s (blinking for its last 3). Arena pools are in 11.2.\n- **Pickup**: a skater body within 12. Icons and timers show over the holder's head.\n\n| Item | Look | Effect |\n|---|---|---|\n| HOT SAUCE | red bottle (store `bottle`) | infinite turbo 8 s, fire trail |\n| GRANDMA'S TAPE | white tape roll | 10 s: can't lose the puck to pokes or checks below a big hit; passes can't be intercepted |\n| POUTINE | bowl of fries (store `bowl`) | 10 s: can't be knocked down; every check is a big hit (×1.6) |\n| LUMBER | a stick with a lightning bolt | the next 3 shots: +30% speed, zero error |\n| BRICK PADS | a brick | the holder's goalie grows ×1.35 for 12 s |\n| BOOM BOX | a boombox | +40 team BOOM |\n| HOT COCOA (pond only) | a steaming thermos | turbo refilled + 20% speed 8 s |\n\n| Hazard | Where | Effect |\n|---|---|---|\n| OCTOPUS | Grindhouse, Dome, cheat | a slip patch r 10: skaters crossing it `slip` (1.2 s, legs up, a slide); at the next stoppage the referee picks it up and twirls it overhead |\n| RUBBER RAT | Grindhouse | scurries randomly for 10 s; trips skaters (as slip) |\n| HATS | after any hat trick | 20–40 hats rain from the stands (cosmetic, swept up at the stoppage) |\n\n- **AI item greed**: a CPU skater not involved in the play (not the carrier, its marker or the pressure player)\n  detours to an item within 120 (`T.aiItemGreed`).\n- **Arena hazards**:\n  - **Thin ice** (pond): 3 elliptical patches (40 × 24) at fixed spots outside the creases, each with integrity 100.\n    A knockdown on a patch costs 50 and a big hit there 100. At 0 the patch breaks into a hole: black water, ripples\n    and a splash. A skater who enters a hole is `frozen` for 3 s (rig tinted icy blue inside a translucent block),\n    then pops out at the edge. A puck that falls in is lost, then a faceoff. Holes refreeze (as a darker patch) after\n    30 s or at intermission.\n  - **Snowbanks** (pond): the boards are snowbanks with no glass. Restitution .3 and a snow puff. A big hit into one\n    leaves the target `buried` for 1.5 s with only the head and skates showing.\n  - **Polar Pete** (mall): the mascot skates figure eights in the neutral zone during play. A moving obstacle (mass\n    1.5) that can be checked (\"MASCOT DOWN!\", BOOM +10); it gets up after 3 s and waves.\n  - **Discount Drop** (mall): every 40 s a ceiling claw lowers a crate to center ice; it breaks into a power-up.\n\n### 7.13 Team AI (`AI`)\n- **Cadence**: each CPU skater re-thinks every `lerp(0.3, 0.12, skill)` s and reacts after `lerp(0.35, 0.1, skill)`\n======\n32:3. **Hockey culture and its voice.** The old barn, the arena organ, the ice resurfacer (our \"Flood Wagon\"), chirping,\n152:  `car.update(dt, map, { steer, gas, brake })`. It drives the Flood Wagon.\n219:  `cutscene`, `match` (pausable: all hockey play, including the shootout and the story games), `flood` (pausable: the\n226:  `#match/<home>/<away>/<arena>`, `#fight`, `#kaboom`, `#shootout`, `#flood`, `#practice/<1-7>`, `#results`,\n337:  the goalie, ✕ butterfly, □ poke, ○ dive. Flood Wagon: the stick steers toward that screen direction, R2/Shift is gas,\n395:  alpha by scuff), and melt draws blue-grey puddles with a shine. The Flood Wagon clears both.\n529:  one-timer +6, deke beat +6, chirp +3, BOOM Box item +40, mascot down +10, perfect Flood Wagon +30, Doris's organ\n633:  shootout: true, intros: true, replays: 'auto', flood: 'ask' | 'always' | 'never', difficulty, cheats, objectives,\n636:  `intermission` (Flood Wagon) → `faceoff` … `final` → `results`. Also `fight`, `ot`, `shootout` and `celebration`.\n650:- **Periods**: the buzzer at 0:00, then the period summary card. **Intermission**: the Flood Wagon minigame (offered\n651:  per the `flood` option; skipping runs a 6 s AI resurfacing fast-forward), then the next period. Teams switch ends\n783:| Story set pieces | The handshake line (two lines sliding past, hands out), the Cup lift (`cheer` with the Cup sprite held at the hands), the Flood Wagon driver seated and steering, Polar Pete's \n819:octopus \"splort\"; KABOOM explosion (engine `explode` + a sub-bass drop); the Flood Wagon engine (a looped low saw\n844:| `flood` | the Flood Wagon minigame | an original skaters' waltz (3/4, organ) |\n875:- **Coach and staff portraits**: Coach Marge Pelletier (grey bun, cardigan, whistle), Old Gus (90, cap, the Flood\n890:`flood-wagon`, `flame-cannon`, `cabin`, `fountain`, `escalator`, `storefront`, `scoreboard`, `kaboom-cup`) and\n905:objectives listed on the pause screen and a pre-game card) → intermission Flood Wagon (offered) → post-game cutscene →\n916:| 1 | **Home Opener** | Ol' Icebox vs Dryfork Drillers, 3 × 1:30; the rivals play one difficulty step below the setting (never below Rookie) | skating, passing, shooting, one-timers, checking, BOO\n972:Look it up.\" → GUS: \"Yep.\" → the Flood Wagon drives a lap with the team on top → **credits** over the run's highlight\n1050:Voices volume · Crowd volume · Player intros (On / Off) · Replays (Auto / Off) · Flood Wagon (Ask / Always / Never) ·\n1085:   3:00, then sudden-death OT capped at 1:00, then a tie. Replays are 3 s, there are no intros and no Flood Wagon;\n1142:  8. *Flood Wagon* (6 s): the AI driver resurfacing scuffed ice.\n1173:  break the thin ice; shatter a panel; trigger the Flood Wagon; go to results, attract, about or the lab.\n1194:| **M6 Story and content** | all 5 arenas dressed (lights, props, crowds, hazards), all 6 teams, the story map, the cutscene runner and every script, choices, objectives, stars and unlocks, the F\n1257:intermission Flood Wagon once with the bot steering, the chapter 4 Shootout Showcase, and the chapter 5 boss phases\n1300:cutscene with a portrait, the story map, a drill, the Flood Wagon, the Dev panel, Settings with Xbox glyphs, the\n1471:**Three stars (CHUCK)**: \"The third star: {name}, who hit everything but the Flood Wagon.\" · \"Second star: {name},","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013c7MHeBxQDs88QytEttijS","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
